Package: tessera-desktop
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Tessera <https://github.com/aliasaf-web/tessera>
Depends: greetd, dbus-user-session, polkitd, git, python3, python3-gi,
 gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-gtk4layershell-1.0, libgtk4-layer-shell0, gir1.2-adw-1,
 gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gsettings-desktop-schemas, dconf-gsettings-backend,
 librsvg2-common, adwaita-icon-theme, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk,
 xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-utils
Recommends: xwayland, network-manager, bluez, rfkill, upower, pipewire-audio,
 wireplumber, pulseaudio-utils, xdg-user-dirs, papirus-icon-theme, fonts-inter,
 fonts-noto-color-emoji, grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, playerctl, foot, thunar,
 firefox-esr, adw-gtk3, gnome-text-editor, loupe, celluloid, pavucontrol,
 file-roller, tumbler, gvfs-backends, lxpolkit, thunar-archive-plugin
Description: the Tessera desktop and the programs it uses
 Depends lists what Tessera cannot work without. Recommends lists the apps
 and features that come with it (Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, sound, terminal, files,
 web browser and more): they are installed the first time, and if you remove
 one later, updates leave it removed. Made by the Tessera installer.
